<title>FRANCE: UIS gets 1.05 bln Ffr syndicated credit.</title>
<headline>UIS gets 1.05 bln Ffr syndicated credit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Societe Generale said on Wednesday it and Commerzbank AG had arranged a 1.05 billion franc syndicated credit for French office financing company UIS.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the operation had originally been envisaged at about 750 million francs.</p>
<p>Maturity date is five years from the signing date of December 12, 1996 while interest is Libor/Pibor plus 0.275 percent.</p>
</text>
